  m_Name: Lancer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: OneMoreKnight::OneMoreKnight.Enemies.EnemyStats
  maxHealth: 2
  moveSpeed: 3
  scoreValue: 150
  contactDamage: 1
  description: A splinter of steel with a single idea. The bolt it fires leaves the
    barrel almost lazily, as if stretching - then remembers its purpose all at once.
  tactics: Fires a green bolt that starts slow and accelerates hard. Your instinct
    calibrates on the launch speed and is wrong by the time it reaches you - dodge
    EARLY, when the bolt is born, not when it looks close. The Lancer itself dives
    fast; two hits kill it.
